<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuadorian footballer Jhon Perlaza received an eight-year ban after throwing a stone at an assistant referee, illustrating violence spilling into sport. Fishermen from Ecuador have filed lawsuits against the United States, alleging a drone strike sank their boat near the Galápagos, linking the incident to broader security concerns. Pete Hegseth met with President Noboa and visited Honduras to discuss regional anti-narco cooperation, extending the focus of security efforts beyond Ecuador. The UCDP counted two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQYU0yT2dDTzZkYmtfLTJmSS1UZTNlc0cyWk1vZEpiM3JVNzFRaGdtMHNfNHpJUjRYaEJRU0p1OFlIb1RtU19rczlWclNCaGkxTVJaX2lybVFVa0pSc0stNVU2dFpaUHlMTWw0Y2R5c1d4SVVpS3NZdEY2X0RrWlNGdmJXVEtsSUdGSnJ4VWZEVjlHZHp5ckZkYU5vMDJpU0pnU1Z3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQaVM4QkVIM2E4RGJ6V2V0WUgzMnZ5OURpUGJWT1JTWEhfVnBKdFFsTjlkYmhiUlVtQWtlaWp5aGlac1g1TjU1bzhFREprNlRQRlhNSDQ2TlRRZDNPWnp5N0ZKejBrWTRXdjZFR002bTBQX3g3Ni1Dc29MS2p6ZWFpT09MaUplZEQ2LWR1UE9WUUpicjBMOGRNMmxFc0t3TXBNS0Zsd2U4RUM3MWlHMFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulse Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNMHdaUGc4MmU4TUpHakI1cU9ndDdQbUZ1TFNKdjlHMFRzNFBZaVF4eDMyX0NpQU4yRlVMQVN3RFpqSUlPYlJQbm4tZl9GSnBRa3RXUndpS0RsYUF6YVBuTWZJTy0zeGVZRExFbDVqN1YwbUVmLXktYmlZSEZxV3pMc1hpR1BRMHhGWV9CWWRSOXpON3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;TVB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE0xT3R3WDBXUzdQLWtveFNYUEYwbzVTZk5yc1VNdmNIcTNuaHctM3FRZlpHX3dIcVF2Ujljb003UlV3N2VVaU9ZRGZqYVE1YWtCSWZ0NEs0MA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangladesh Sangbad Sangstha (BSS)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.go